    {
      "id": "set_aux_function",
      "title": {
        "en": "Set the aux relay (R2) function",
        "nl": "Zet de hulprelais-functie (R2)"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Set the aux relay (R2) function to [[mode]]",
        "nl": "Zet de hulprelais-functie (R2) op [[mode]]"
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "mode",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "values": [
            {
              "id": "disabled",
              "label": {
                "en": "Disabled",
                "nl": "Uitgeschakeld"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "heating",
              "label": {
                "en": "Heating demand",
                "nl": "Warmtevraag"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cooling",
              "label": {
                "en": "Cooling demand",
                "nl": "Koelvraag"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "heating_or_cooling",
              "label": {
                "en": "Heating or cooling demand",
                "nl": "Warmte- of koelvraag"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "external",
              "label": {
                "en": "External control",
                "nl": "Externe besturing"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "hint": {
        "en": "Chooses what the R2 relay follows. Pick External control to switch it yourself with the Switch the aux relay (R2) card.",
        "nl": "Bepaalt wat het R2-relais volgt. Kies Externe besturing om het zelf te schakelen met de kaart Schakel het hulprelais (R2)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send_dew_point",
      "title": {
        "en": "Send dew point to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur dauwpunt naar de controller"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Send dew point [[dewpoint]] °C to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur dauwpunt [[dewpoint]] °C naar de controller"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Sent straight to the controller (firmware with API input support; MQTT as fallback via the device settings). The last value is re-sent every minute until it expires.",
        "nl": "Gaat rechtstreeks naar de controller (firmware met API-invoer; MQTT als fallback via de apparaatinstellingen). De laatste waarde wordt elke minuut opnieuw verstuurd totdat deze verloopt."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "dewpoint",
          "type": "number",
          "min": -20,
          "max": 35,
          "step": 0.1,
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Dew point (°C)",
            "nl": "Dauwpunt (°C)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "send_room_dew_point",
      "title": {
        "en": "Update the dew point for a room",
        "nl": "Werk het dauwpunt van een ruimte bij"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Update the dew point for [[room]] from temperature [[temperature]] °C and humidity [[humidity]] %",
        "nl": "Werk het dauwpunt van [[room]] bij met temperatuur [[temperature]] °C en luchtvochtigheid [[humidity]] %"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Calculates the room's dew point from temperature and relative humidity; the highest recently updated room is sent straight to the controller (firmware with API input support; MQTT as fallback via the device settings).",
        "nl": "Berekent het dauwpunt van de ruimte uit temperatuur en relatieve luchtvochtigheid; de hoogste recent bijgewerkte ruimte gaat rechtstreeks naar de controller (firmware met API-invoer; MQTT als fallback via de apparaatinstellingen)."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "room",
          "type": "text",
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Living room",
            "nl": "Woonkamer"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 50,
          "step": 0.1,
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Temperature (°C)",
            "nl": "Temperatuur (°C)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "humidity",
          "type": "number",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 100,
          "step": 0.1,
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Humidity (%)",
            "nl": "Luchtvochtigheid (%)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "tokens": [
        {
          "name": "dewpoint",
          "type": "number",
          "title": {
            "en": "Dew point",
            "nl": "Dauwpunt"
          },
          "example": 12.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "send_outside_temperature",
      "title": {
        "en": "Send the outside temperature to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur de buitentemperatuur naar de controller"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Send outside temperature [[temperature]] °C to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur buitentemperatuur [[temperature]] °C naar de controller"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Sent straight to the controller (firmware with API input support; MQTT as fallback via the device settings). The last value is re-sent every minute until it expires. Pick the source in the OpenQuatt web app under Settings → Sources / integrations → Sensor selection.",
        "nl": "Gaat rechtstreeks naar de controller (firmware met API-invoer; MQTT als fallback via de apparaatinstellingen). De laatste waarde wordt elke minuut opnieuw verstuurd totdat deze verloopt. Kies de bron in de OpenQuatt web-app bij Instellingen → Bronnen / integraties → Sensorselectie."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "min": -40,
          "max": 60,
          "step": 0.1,
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Outside temperature (°C)",
            "nl": "Buitentemperatuur (°C)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "send_room_temperature",
      "title": {
        "en": "Send the room temperature to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur de kamertemperatuur naar de controller"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Send room temperature [[temperature]] °C to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur kamertemperatuur [[temperature]] °C naar de controller"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Sent straight to the controller (firmware with API input support; MQTT as fallback via the device settings). The last value is re-sent every minute until it expires. Pick the source in the OpenQuatt web app under Settings → Sources / integrations → Sensor selection.",
        "nl": "Gaat rechtstreeks naar de controller (firmware met API-invoer; MQTT als fallback via de apparaatinstellingen). De laatste waarde wordt elke minuut opnieuw verstuurd totdat deze verloopt. Kies de bron in de OpenQuatt web-app bij Instellingen → Bronnen / integraties → Sensorselectie."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 50,
          "step": 0.1,
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Room temperature (°C)",
            "nl": "Kamertemperatuur (°C)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "send_room_setpoint",
      "title": {
        "en": "Send the room setpoint to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur het kamer-setpoint naar de controller"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Send room setpoint [[setpoint]] °C to the controller",
        "nl": "Stuur kamer-setpoint [[setpoint]] °C naar de controller"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Sent straight to the controller (firmware with API input support; MQTT as fallback via the device settings). The controller keeps this value until you send a new one; the app re-sends it every minute and after a restart. Pick the source in the OpenQuatt web app under Settings → Sources / integrations → Sensor selection.",
        "nl": "Gaat rechtstreeks naar de controller (firmware met API-invoer; MQTT als fallback via de apparaatinstellingen). De controller houdt deze waarde vast tot je een nieuwe stuurt; de app verstuurt hem elke minuut en na een herstart opnieuw. Kies de bron in de OpenQuatt web-app bij Instellingen → Bronnen / integraties → Sensorselectie."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "setpoint",
          "type": "number",
          "min": 5,
          "max": 35,
          "step": 0.1,
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Setpoint (°C)",
            "nl": "Setpoint (°C)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "set_heating_permission",
      "title": {
        "en": "Set heating permission",
        "nl": "Zet warmtetoestemming"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Set heating permission [[state]]",
        "nl": "Zet warmtetoestemming [[state]]"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Tells the controller whether heating is allowed at all. Sent straight to the controller (firmware with API input support; MQTT as fallback via the device settings). The controller keeps this value until you send a new one; the app re-sends it every minute and after a restart. Pick the source in the OpenQuatt web app under Settings → Sources / integrations → Sensor selection.",
        "nl": "Vertelt de controller of verwarmen überhaupt is toegestaan. Gaat rechtstreeks naar de controller (firmware met API-invoer; MQTT als fallback via de apparaatinstellingen). De controller houdt deze waarde vast tot je een nieuwe stuurt; de app verstuurt hem elke minuut en na een herstart opnieuw. Kies de bron in de OpenQuatt web-app bij Instellingen → Bronnen / integraties → Sensorselectie."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "state",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "values": [
            {
              "id": "on",
              "label": {
                "en": "On",
                "nl": "Aan"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "off",
              "label": {
                "en": "Off",
                "nl": "Uit"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "set_aux_relay",
      "title": {
        "en": "Switch the aux relay (R2)",
        "nl": "Schakel het hulprelais (R2)"
      },
      "titleFormatted": {
        "en": "Switch the aux relay (R2) [[state]]",
        "nl": "Schakel het hulprelais (R2) [[state]]"
      },
      "hint": {
        "en": "Switches the R2 contact itself. Only works while the aux relay function is set to External control.",
        "nl": "Schakelt het R2-contact zelf. Werkt alleen als de hulprelais-functie op Externe besturing staat."
      },
      "args": [
        {
          "name": "state",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "values": [
            {
              "id": "on",
              "label": {
                "en": "On",
                "nl": "Aan"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "off",
              "label": {
                "en": "Off",
                "nl": "Uit"
              }
